message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the article and this replication package."
title: "Replication package: What Changed in Engineering Writing After Generative AI Chat Assistants"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-07"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Cokyasar
    given-names: Taner
    affiliation: "Texas A&M University"
    email: tcokyasar@tamu.edu
keywords:
  - bibliometrics
  - scholarly writing
  - large language models
  - OpenAlex
  - interrupted time series
abstract: >-
  Code and data that build a corpus of 1.84 million research articles from 256
  engineering journals (2015-2025) from OpenAlex, recover missing abstracts, measure
  word use in abstracts and in a sample of full texts, and estimate departures from
  pre-2023 trends after the release of ChatGPT.
